intl: internationalization with ICU of the package az (collation,
number and date formats, normalization, transliteration).

The module intl of PHP 7.4 for php74 of azsupport/ports, which installs
side by side with the other versions of PHP: lib/php/20190902/intl.so,
loaded by its ini in etc/php74/conf.d, its headers in
include/php74/php/ext/intl.
